#!/usr/bin/env sage
"""
MOP for mixed Beukers kernel — fixed version using direct linear solve.

Type II MOP conditions:
  Σ_{k=0}^n c_{n,k} · ψ_j(k+s) = 0   for s = 1,...,n_j   (j=1 for ζ(2), j=2 for ζ(3))
with n₁ + n₂ = n.

Set c_n = 1 (monic) → solve n×n system for c_0,...,c_{n-1}.
"""


